(7291111, 1136734, 37858, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but it looks more like Weston than Adams to me.  Still, it''s well done IMHO.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but it looks more like Weston than Adams to me.  Still, it''s well done IMHO.', '2014-12-08 00:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
