(7291325, 1136750, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the trees, but the texture in the snow is too much for me.</td>', 'I love the trees, but the texture in the snow is too much for me.', '2014-12-08 14:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291326, 1136572, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha, this reminds me more of Monet than Adams :)</td>', 'Ha, this reminds me more of Monet than Adams :)', '2014-12-08 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291327, 1136734, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful find, and more reminiscent of O''Keefe to me.</td>', 'Beautiful find, and more reminiscent of O''Keefe to me.', '2014-12-08 14:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291328, 1136720, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating glimpse of two worlds side by side</td>', 'What a fascinating glimpse of two worlds side by side', '2014-12-08 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291330, 1136680, 96751, '<td valign="top">This made me sigh.  Beautiful. Love the horizontal bands, great detail in the center flanked with refreshing smoothness. Love it.</td>', 'This made me sigh.  Beautiful. Love the horizontal bands, great detail in the center flanked with refreshing smoothness. Love it.', '2014-12-08 14:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291331, 1136755, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.</td>', 'Awesome composition.', '2014-12-08 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291332, 1136715, 96751, '<td valign="top">Primeval!</td>', 'Primeval!', '2014-12-08 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291335, 1136767, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love everything about this. If it doesn''t do well it''s because he''s not known for macros :)</td>', 'Beautiful. Love everything about this. If it doesn''t do well it''s because he''s not known for macros :)', '2014-12-08 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291336, 1136524, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like an image from the 1800s</td>', 'Like an image from the 1800s', '2014-12-08 14:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291337, 1136740, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lines are gorgeous, but this lacks the sharpness, depth, contrast of an Adams. A nice tribute, but in your own style ;)</td>', 'The lines are gorgeous, but this lacks the sharpness, depth, contrast of an Adams. A nice tribute, but in your own style ;)', '2014-12-08 14:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291338, 1136595, 96751, '<td valign="top">Must be a Hahn :)<br/> <br/>A wonderful view, but something funky has happened to the tree at lower left. Like the shadows were boosted too much, and it''s got that murky, clipped look.</td>', 'Must be a Hahn :) A wonderful view, but something funky has happened to the tree at lower left. Like the shadows were boosted too much, and it''s got that murky, clipped look.', '2014-12-08 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291339, 1136537, 96751, '<td valign="top">The mist between the valleys is divine. Loving the subtle textures in the foreground.</td>', 'The mist between the valleys is divine. Loving the subtle textures in the foreground.', '2014-12-08 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291340, 1136564, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hey, that tree is being stalked...</td>', 'Hey, that tree is being stalked...', '2014-12-08 14:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291341, 1136748, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, what a view.</td>', 'Ah, what a view.', '2014-12-08 14:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291342, 1136598, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is sublime. This is my blue. Masterful pp''g.</td>', 'This is sublime. This is my blue. Masterful pp''g.', '2014-12-08 14:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291347, 1136671, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the lines but the rose looks so solid to me...</td>', 'I love the lines but the rose looks so solid to me...', '2014-12-08 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291348, 1136738, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an itty bitty church!</td>', 'What an itty bitty church!', '2014-12-08 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291349, 1136660, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful find</td>', 'What a wonderful find', '2014-12-08 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291350, 1136694, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun interpretations but way too dark for me</td>', 'Fun interpretations but way too dark for me', '2014-12-08 14:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291351, 1136672, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow, great find. What a cooperating sky!</td>', 'Wow, great find. What a cooperating sky!', '2014-12-08 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291352, 1136742, 96751, '<td valign="top">Above it all</td>', 'Above it all', '2014-12-08 14:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291354, 1136771, 96751, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems tilted, and on a shot like this, soooo distracting. Great perspective on the city, though...</td>', 'The horizon seems tilted, and on a shot like this, soooo distracting. Great perspective on the city, though...', '2014-12-08 14:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291359, 1136744, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lack of contrast really impacts this image negatively</td>', 'The lack of contrast really impacts this image negatively', '2014-12-08 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291360, 1136757, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot of the San Remo!!!!</td>', 'Awesome shot of the San Remo!!!!', '2014-12-08 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291361, 1136781, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cool weaving!</td>', 'Cool weaving!', '2014-12-08 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291362, 1136657, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous natural diptych. How nice to have this for a back yard.</td>', 'Fabulous natural diptych. How nice to have this for a back yard.', '2014-12-08 15:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291364, 1136769, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely contre jour. My emotional favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely contre jour. My emotional favorite of the challenge.', '2014-12-08 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291365, 1136722, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but something''s not working for me with the pp''g. Too sharpened, maybe, or maybe it''s a lack of contrast...</td>', 'Nice landscape, but something''s not working for me with the pp''g. Too sharpened, maybe, or maybe it''s a lack of contrast...', '2014-12-08 15:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291366, 1136659, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great symmetry, lines, reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great symmetry, lines, reflection.', '2014-12-08 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291409, 1136671, 163430, '<td valign="top">These are the most unappreciated submission in Ansel Adams themed challenges. Like everyone suddenly forgets the "Rose and Driftwood" image and all they can remember is Yellowstone Park and that old church in New Mexico. <br/>This is an excellent take on "Rose and Driftwood". I almost submitted one myself. The lighting on the sore is spot on. Looks like the real thing. I only wish that there was more texture of the wood present.</td>', 'These are the most unappreciated submission in Ansel Adams themed challenges. Like everyone suddenly forgets the "Rose and Driftwood" image and all they can remember is Yellowstone Park and that old church in New Mexico. This is an excellent take on "Rose and Driftwood". I almost submitted one myself. The lighting on the sore is spot on. Looks like the real thing. I only wish that there was more texture of the wood present.', '2014-12-08 19:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291410, 1136757, 163430, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and processing. I like the way symmetry works here with the tree in the center and the two "towers" on left and right. My only remark is that is lacks that Ansel Adams feel. Dramatic blacks and deep dark detailed shadows, as well as more highlights in the water.</td>', 'Excellent composition and processing. I like the way symmetry works here with the tree in the center and the two "towers" on left and right. My only remark is that is lacks that Ansel Adams feel. Dramatic blacks and deep dark detailed shadows, as well as more highlights in the water.', '2014-12-08 19:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291411, 1136761, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice one. If only the whole of the rives was in the highlight zone.</td>', 'Nice one. If only the whole of the rives was in the highlight zone.', '2014-12-08 19:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291413, 1136660, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and crisp details, but why, in God''s name, is the horizon in the dead center of the image? It confuses me as a viewer and distracts me from that "One Tree".<br/> <br/>As i write this comment, the image is scrolled down so the top half of the sky (or the top quarter of the image) is cropped out. It''s a totally different experience. It looses some of the lice clouds at the top but that''s nothing compared to the improvement in the composition. It has both the Ansel Adams feel in the tonal range (that your original already has) plus that WOW effect. Try it for yourself.</td>', 'Nice tones and crisp details, but why, in God''s name, is the horizon in the dead center of the image? It confuses me as a viewer and distracts me from that "One Tree". As i write this comment, the image is scrolled down so the top half of the sky (or the top quarter of the image) is cropped out. It''s a totally different experience. It looses some of the lice clouds at the top but that''s nothing compared to the improvement in the composition. It has both the Ansel Adams feel in the tonal range (that your original already has) plus that WOW effect. Try it for yourself.', '2014-12-08 19:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291420, 1136738, 163430, '<td valign="top">Something is not straight here, but i cannot put my finger on it. I might as well be that the "horizontals" on the building itself are not parallel. Wonderful image in the true style of the old master, nevertheless.</td>', 'Something is not straight here, but i cannot put my finger on it. I might as well be that the "horizontals" on the building itself are not parallel. Wonderful image in the true style of the old master, nevertheless.', '2014-12-08 19:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291421, 1136739, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the subject. Replicating Ansel Adams'' style without using his usual subjects. I like it, but i doubt that the rest of the voters will appreciate it since it goes against the words in challenge description (landscape is mentioned twice).</td>', 'Interesting take on the subject. Replicating Ansel Adams'' style without using his usual subjects. I like it, but i doubt that the rest of the voters will appreciate it since it goes against the words in challenge description (landscape is mentioned twice).', '2014-12-08 19:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291422, 1136673, 163430, '<td valign="top">What is this? Is it an aerial shot from above the clouds looking down? Looks like that.<br/> <br/>Whatever it is, i cannot decide how well it fits the challenge right now. I will come back and vote when i''m sure :-)</td>', 'What is this? Is it an aerial shot from above the clouds looking down? Looks like that. Whatever it is, i cannot decide how well it fits the challenge right now. I will come back and vote when i''m sure :-)', '2014-12-08 19:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291425, 1136722, 163430, '<td valign="top">There are rare situations where the centered horizon works well. This is not one of them :-( It distracts me from the other elements in the image. As with the other elements, Adams used lots of dodge and burn in developing the print in order to produce the characteristic dramatic tonal range he is famous for. Most of his famous images are processed during development. I would prefer a processing in which the vegetation on the left is a tad darker (one zone blow current) and the stream in the same zone as the snow.</td>', 'There are rare situations where the centered horizon works well. This is not one of them :-( It distracts me from the other elements in the image. As with the other elements, Adams used lots of dodge and burn in developing the print in order to produce the characteristic dramatic tonal range he is famous for. Most of his famous images are processed during development. I would prefer a processing in which the vegetation on the left is a tad darker (one zone blow current) and the stream in the same zone as the snow.', '2014-12-08 20:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291427, 1136773, 163430, '<td valign="top">I just can''t see Ansel Adams in this shot :-(<br/>The image is too grainy and kills the details in the shadows. There is not enough elements with tonal variation. It''s just dark trees and cloudy sky.</td>', 'I just can''t see Ansel Adams in this shot :-(The image is too grainy and kills the details in the shadows. There is not enough elements with tonal variation. It''s just dark trees and cloudy sky.', '2014-12-08 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291430, 1136760, 163430, '<td valign="top">Although Adams is known to experiment with color film, his primary works was done in black and white. Even when he did work with color, his landscapes are full of details, high tonal ranges and vibrant colors. A total opposite of your submission.<br/> <br/>DNMC :-(</td>', 'Although Adams is known to experiment with color film, his primary works was done in black and white. Even when he did work with color, his landscapes are full of details, high tonal ranges and vibrant colors. A total opposite of your submission. DNMC :-(', '2014-12-08 20:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291432, 1136680, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. Sharp all over with crisp details. The tonal range is all over the zones. The thing i like the most is that the subject is so simple and effective. The Ansel Adams style is present in the image in all the aspects except the choice of subject, and that''s, IMHO, the true spirit of the challenge. <br/>BRAVO!</td>', 'I like this one a lot. Sharp all over with crisp details. The tonal range is all over the zones. The thing i like the most is that the subject is so simple and effective. The Ansel Adams style is present in the image in all the aspects except the choice of subject, and that''s, IMHO, the true spirit of the challenge. BRAVO!', '2014-12-08 20:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291435, 1136737, 163430, '<td valign="top">The tones in this image are too flat and the details on the tree lines in the back are lost. A total opposite to the work of Ansel Adams.<br/>DNMC :-(</td>', 'The tones in this image are too flat and the details on the tree lines in the back are lost. A total opposite to the work of Ansel Adams.DNMC :-(', '2014-12-08 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291436, 1136694, 163430, '<td valign="top">Except for the drama in the clouds there is little of the spirit of Ansel Adams in this shot :-(<br/>No details in the tree, no sharpness in the clouds and that white house on the right just doesn''t belong here.</td>', 'Except for the drama in the clouds there is little of the spirit of Ansel Adams in this shot :-(No details in the tree, no sharpness in the clouds and that white house on the right just doesn''t belong here.', '2014-12-08 20:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7291439, 1136537, 163430, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you could have pulled more details in the clouds. Either in capture or in post.<br/> <br/>Stunning image BTW. This is just my curiosity asking questions because mine lacks details in the clouds as well :-)</td>', 'I wonder if you could have pulled more details in the clouds. Either in capture or in post. Stunning image BTW. This is just my curiosity asking questions because mine lacks details in the clouds as well :-)', '2014-12-08 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
