(7292511, 1136715, 136582, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2014-12-13 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292513, 1136781, 136582, '<td valign="top">Love this 10!</td>', 'Love this 10!', '2014-12-13 18:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292514, 1136734, 136582, '<td valign="top">great shot! 10!</td>', 'great shot! 10!', '2014-12-13 18:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292516, 1136704, 136582, '<td valign="top">No on so many levels. Google Ansel Adams before you enter a challenge like this.</td>', 'No on so many levels. Google Ansel Adams before you enter a challenge like this.', '2014-12-13 18:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292517, 1136780, 136582, '<td valign="top">Great shot but, the power lines ruin it for me and the proccess and sharpness is not quite right.</td>', 'Great shot but, the power lines ruin it for me and the proccess and sharpness is not quite right.', '2014-12-13 18:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292518, 1136738, 136582, '<td valign="top">No</td>', 'No', '2014-12-13 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292519, 1136750, 136582, '<td valign="top">You have too much proccessing here, especially the snow. Great shot but, mind the brightness of the snow and give it luster. It looks like it was a shot from the aftermath of Chernobyl.</td>', 'You have too much proccessing here, especially the snow. Great shot but, mind the brightness of the snow and give it luster. It looks like it was a shot from the aftermath of Chernobyl.', '2014-12-13 18:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292520, 1136771, 136582, '<td valign="top">No</td>', 'No', '2014-12-13 18:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292521, 1136524, 136582, '<td valign="top">no</td>', 'no', '2014-12-13 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292522, 1136659, 136582, '<td valign="top">Yawn.....</td>', 'Yawn.....', '2014-12-13 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292523, 1136747, 136582, '<td valign="top">No</td>', 'No', '2014-12-13 18:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292524, 1136672, 136582, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. The sky however needs to be black like Ansel did and the clouds should be puffy white. He did a lot of reversal in his proccessing which made his photos what they are.</td>', 'Very nice capture. The sky however needs to be black like Ansel did and the clouds should be puffy white. He did a lot of reversal in his proccessing which made his photos what they are.', '2014-12-13 18:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292525, 1136763, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky is fantastic.  The tree is only OK. The road and cars are major distractions. 8</td>', 'The sky is fantastic.  The tree is only OK. The road and cars are major distractions. 8', '2014-12-13 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292559, 1136660, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and I like the processing, though the sky feels a little blown out at the horizon.  It also feels like it tilts left a bit.</td>', 'Nicely captured and I like the processing, though the sky feels a little blown out at the horizon.  It also feels like it tilts left a bit.', '2014-12-14 08:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292560, 1136673, 156466, '<td valign="top">Clouds just too blown out.  Ansel must have a big tripod. ;)</td>', 'Clouds just too blown out.  Ansel must have a big tripod. ;)', '2014-12-14 08:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292561, 1136740, 156466, '<td valign="top">Ansel-ish, but just not nearly crisp enough in the shot and processing.</td>', 'Ansel-ish, but just not nearly crisp enough in the shot and processing.', '2014-12-14 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292562, 1136737, 156466, '<td valign="top">Needs a lot more contrast and definition.</td>', 'Needs a lot more contrast and definition.', '2014-12-14 08:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292563, 1136781, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really nicely taken and processed.  The fronds at the bottom are a little distracting and take away from the look of the solo tree, which is well seen and processed.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Really nicely taken and processed.  The fronds at the bottom are a little distracting and take away from the look of the solo tree, which is well seen and processed.  One of my favorites so far.', '2014-12-14 08:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292564, 1136744, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would love to see some more definition in the grasses.</td>', 'Would love to see some more definition in the grasses.', '2014-12-14 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292565, 1136759, 156466, '<td valign="top">Need to bring the detail in the trees out a bit more.  Adams'' work is, if nothing else, crisp in its details.</td>', 'Need to bring the detail in the trees out a bit more.  Adams'' work is, if nothing else, crisp in its details.', '2014-12-14 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292566, 1136680, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the detail of the trees and both the snow and sky.  Very well done.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the detail of the trees and both the snow and sky.  Very well done.', '2014-12-14 08:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292567, 1136657, 156466, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like to photos composited at first glance.  Change in wall levels and the starkness of the sky to the left gives the photo a feeling of being off balance (not that it''s a bad thing).  Processing is spot on for this challenge.  In my top 5 for sure.</td>', 'Almost looks like to photos composited at first glance.  Change in wall levels and the starkness of the sky to the left gives the photo a feeling of being off balance (not that it''s a bad thing).  Processing is spot on for this challenge.  In my top 5 for sure.', '2014-12-14 08:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292568, 1136564, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the border on this one.</td>', 'Not a fan of the border on this one.', '2014-12-14 08:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292569, 1136748, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken and processed.  Feels just a little soft - possibly small aperture diffraction?  A little bit of haloing on the slopes but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Very nicely taken and processed.  Feels just a little soft - possibly small aperture diffraction?  A little bit of haloing on the slopes but otherwise very nice.', '2014-12-14 08:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292570, 1136694, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just too dark to get a feel for the "twin" or the detail in the trees.  Nice photo, but the lack of detail in the subject makes it very un-Ansel.</td>', 'Just too dark to get a feel for the "twin" or the detail in the trees.  Nice photo, but the lack of detail in the subject makes it very un-Ansel.', '2014-12-14 08:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292571, 1136715, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like the look but not the processing.  I''d love to see more detail in the twisted bark.  Really midtone heavy through the center.</td>', 'I like the look but not the processing.  I''d love to see more detail in the twisted bark.  Really midtone heavy through the center.', '2014-12-14 08:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292574, 1136780, 156466, '<td valign="top">So wish you''d gotten rid of that power line in the distance and the haloing along the top.  Otherwise well seen and processed.</td>', 'So wish you''d gotten rid of that power line in the distance and the haloing along the top.  Otherwise well seen and processed.', '2014-12-14 08:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292575, 1136595, 156466, '<td valign="top">Jealous of the folks who had vistas like this to shoot for this challenge - and any other time.  You nailed this one.  Well done.</td>', 'Jealous of the folks who had vistas like this to shoot for this challenge - and any other time.  You nailed this one.  Well done.', '2014-12-14 08:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292576, 1136763, 156466, '<td valign="top">I know you couldn''t do much about the cars, but how I wish they weren''t there.  The foreground branch (bottom right) is also a problem.  Without them this would be in my top 3.  The rest is lovely.</td>', 'I know you couldn''t do much about the cars, but how I wish they weren''t there.  The foreground branch (bottom right) is also a problem.  Without them this would be in my top 3.  The rest is lovely.', '2014-12-14 08:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292577, 1136537, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the toning.  Otherwise I like this a lot.</td>', 'Not a fan of the toning.  Otherwise I like this a lot.', '2014-12-14 08:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292578, 1136704, 156466, '<td valign="top">I think you could have had something really nice with the shot, but the processing just doesn''t work for me at all.</td>', 'I think you could have had something really nice with the shot, but the processing just doesn''t work for me at all.', '2014-12-14 08:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292579, 1136768, 156466, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place, but the composition just doesn''t do it for me.  Too much water without much detail.  Makes me wish the camera was 2-3 feet closer to the ground and aimed higher.</td>', 'Beautiful place, but the composition just doesn''t do it for me.  Too much water without much detail.  Makes me wish the camera was 2-3 feet closer to the ground and aimed higher.', '2014-12-14 08:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292580, 1136750, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice.  Might be just a little to high on the structure scale (said the guy who knows all about doing that) as evidenced by the haloing around the trees.  Might have liked a little more midtone detail in the shadows, but that''s just being picky.</td>', 'Really, really nice.  Might be just a little to high on the structure scale (said the guy who knows all about doing that) as evidenced by the haloing around the trees.  Might have liked a little more midtone detail in the shadows, but that''s just being picky.', '2014-12-14 08:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292581, 1136598, 156466, '<td valign="top">My winner so far.</td>', 'My winner so far.', '2014-12-14 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292582, 1136747, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little too soft and grainy for me.</td>', 'A little too soft and grainy for me.', '2014-12-14 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292583, 1136757, 156466, '<td valign="top">Outside of the ghosting around the building (which I will admit <i>might</i> be due to exterior lighting through the center) I like it.  Might like it more with the sky and possibly the water burned in some more.</td>', 'Outside of the ghosting around the building (which I will admit might be due to exterior lighting through the center) I like it.  Might like it more with the sky and possibly the water burned in some more.', '2014-12-14 08:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292585, 1136745, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m left wondering what you could have done from the other side of the highway.</td>', 'I''m left wondering what you could have done from the other side of the highway.', '2014-12-14 08:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292586, 1136657, 61396, '<td valign="top">nice layering</td>', 'nice layering', '2014-12-14 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292587, 1136740, 61396, '<td valign="top">unorthodox contrast</td>', 'unorthodox contrast', '2014-12-14 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292588, 1136734, 61396, '<td valign="top">great textures and a sense of mystery</td>', 'great textures and a sense of mystery', '2014-12-14 09:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292589, 1136516, 61396, '<td valign="top">good light</td>', 'good light', '2014-12-14 09:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7292592, 1136760, 156466, '<td valign="top">Were Adams not so ubiquitous with the B&amp;W Zone System I might not be so put off by a color image.  I get wanting to be different, but there''s a spirit of the challenge thing that goes beyond a nice vista.  Nice photo but definitely a DNMC in my book.</td>', 'Were Adams not so ubiquitous with the B&W Zone System I might not be so put off by a color image.  I get wanting to be different, but there''s a spirit of the challenge thing that goes beyond a nice vista.  Nice photo but definitely a DNMC in my book.', '2014-12-14 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
