(7293044, 1136734, 124982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Garry:</b></div><hr/><i> Bizarre composition, but quite lovely. Very nicely processed -- almost <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a>-like. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! The similarity is eerie!</td>', 'Originally posted by Garry: Bizarre composition, but quite lovely. Very nicely processed -- almost  Bear_Music-like.   Ha! The similarity is eerie!', '2014-12-15 08:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
