(7293074, 1136537, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great image, and very on-subject; I didn''t figure this for yours though. I have to say that this reminds me so much of where I grew up, it was very easy to just sit and hear the waves, smell the salt air and feel the wind, this truly transcended the monitor viewing experience for me.</td>', 'Great image, and very on-subject; I didn''t figure this for yours though. I have to say that this reminds me so much of where I grew up, it was very easy to just sit and hear the waves, smell the salt air and feel the wind, this truly transcended the monitor viewing experience for me.', '2014-12-15 09:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
