(7293201, 1136748, 163430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by backdoorhippie:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nicely taken and processed.  Feels just a little soft - possibly small aperture diffraction?  A little bit of haloing on the slopes but otherwise very nice. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Could be diffraction. Apparently f/16 is too small of an aperture for a 24mpx APS-C sensor. I did try some focus stacking but with no success. I''m yet to perfect this technique. <br/> <br/>Thank you all on your kind comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by backdoorhippie: Very nicely taken and processed.  Feels just a little soft - possibly small aperture diffraction?  A little bit of haloing on the slopes but otherwise very nice.   Could be diffraction. Apparently f/16 is too small of an aperture for a 24mpx APS-C sensor. I did try some focus stacking but with no success. I''m yet to perfect this technique.  Thank you all on your kind comments.', '2014-12-15 14:34:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7293245, 1136755, 70270, '<td valign="top">Hey Mark, I was your 10.  Loved the tone control in this, the range of blacks was outstanding, and very Ansel like.  Now that I see its yours I''m not surprised.   <br/></td>', 'Hey Mark, I was your 10.  Loved the tone control in this, the range of blacks was outstanding, and very Ansel like.  Now that I see its yours I''m not surprised.   ', '2014-12-15 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7293364, 1136781, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I find trees surprisingly difficult to photograph well, so kudos to you for capturing this lovely image, and for your processing. As others have said great details and tones.  I gave it an 8.<br/> <br/>Edited for typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-12-16 12:29:31.</i></td>', 'Wonderful. I find trees surprisingly difficult to photograph well, so kudos to you for capturing this lovely image, and for your processing. As others have said great details and tones.  I gave it an 8. Edited for typo', '2014-12-16 10:17:50.000000', '2014-12-16 12:29:31.000000', 0),
